msgid "Are you sure you want to create a server?"
msgstr "确定要创建服务器吗？"

msgid "Creating a server won't allow you play Minecraft, it's for letting others play together.<br/><br/>If you just want to play Minecraft, you don't want to create a server, and instead will want to create an instance.<br/><br/>Are you sure you want to create a server?"
msgstr "创建服务器并不能让你自己游玩 Minecraft，它的用途是让别人一起联机。<br/><br/>如果你只是想玩 Minecraft，那么你要的不是服务器，而是创建一个实例。<br/><br/>确定要创建服务器吗？"

msgid "Are you sure you want to kill the Minecraft process?<br/><br/>Doing so can cause corruption of your saves."
msgstr "确定要强制结束 Minecraft 进程吗？<br/><br/>这样做可能会损坏你的存档。"

