msgid "There was an issue updating the bundled JRE. Please try again later and if the issue persists, please contact ATLauncher support via Discord."
msgstr "更新内置 JRE 时出现问题。请稍后重试；如果问题仍然存在，请通过 Discord 联系 ATLauncher 支持。"

msgid "This account doesn't have a valid purchase of Minecraft.<br/><br/>Please make sure you've bought the Java edition of Minecraft and then try again.<br/><br/>If you have Xbox Game Pass, you need to login through the Minecraft launcher<br/>at least once and launch the game once in order to create your username."
msgstr "此账户没有有效购买的 Minecraft。<br/><br/>请确保你已购买 Minecraft Java 版，然后重试。<br/><br/>如果你有 Xbox Game Pass，需要至少通过 Minecraft 官方启动器<br/>登录一次并启动一次游戏，才能创建你的用户名。"

msgid "This allows you to override which runtime is used to launch this instance.<br/><br/>Runtimes are provided by Mojang and used to launch the game and generally correspond to a particular Java version.<br/><br/>Changing this is usually not required or recommended."
msgstr "这允许你覆盖用于启动该实例的运行时。<br/><br/>运行时由 Mojang 提供，用于启动游戏，通常对应特定的 Java 版本。<br/><br/>通常不需要也不建议更改此项。"

msgid "This instance cannot be started due to missing libraries that cannot be downloaded.<br/><br/>Please reinstall the instance to create those libraries and be able to start this instance again."
msgstr "由于缺失无法下载的依赖库，该实例无法启动。<br/><br/>请重新安装该实例以创建这些依赖库，然后才能再次启动。"

#. {0} is the minimum permgen in MB
msgid "This pack has set a minimum amount of permgen to <b>{0}</b> MB.<br/><br/>Do you want to continue loading the instance anyway?"
msgstr "此整合包设置了最小 Permgen 为 <b>{0}</b> MB。<br/><br/>仍要继续加载该实例吗？"

#. {0} is the minimum ram in MB
msgid "This pack has set a minimum amount of ram needed to <b>{0}</b> MB.<br/><br/>Do you want to continue loading the instance anyway?"
msgstr "此整合包设置了最小内存需求为 <b>{0}</b> MB。<br/><br/>仍要继续加载该实例吗？"

msgid "This server is currently vulnerable to the Log4Shell exploit.<br/><br/>For your safety, and of those on your server, please delete and recreate this server.<br/><br/>Do you still want to launch the server (not recommended)?"
msgstr "此服务器当前易受 Log4Shell 漏洞攻击。<br/><br/>为了你以及服务器上其他玩家的安全，请删除并重新创建此服务器。<br/><br/>仍要启动此服务器吗（不推荐）？"

msgid "This setting allows you to specify where your Java Path is.<br/><br/>This should be left as default, but if you know what you're doing, just set<br/>this to the path where the bin folder is for the version of Java you want to use.<br/><br/>If you mess up, click the Reset button to go back to the default"
msgstr "此设置允许你指定 Java 路径的位置。<br/><br/>一般应保持默认，但如果你清楚自己在做什么，可以将其设置为<br/>你想使用的 Java 版本的 bin 文件夹所在路径。<br/><br/>如果设置出错，点击“重置”按钮即可恢复默认。"

msgid "This version of Minecraft provides a specific version of Java to be used with it, so you cannot set a custom Java path.<br/><br/>In order to manually set a path, you must disable this option (highly not recommended)."
msgstr "此版本的 Minecraft 提供了与其配套使用的特定 Java 版本，因此无法设置自定义 Java 路径。<br/><br/>如需手动设置路径，必须禁用此选项（强烈不建议）。"

msgid "This will delete the selected mods from the instance.<br/><br/>Are you sure you want to do this?"
msgstr "这将从实例中删除选中的模组。<br/><br/>确定要这样做吗？"

