msgid "We cannot launch this server for you. Please use \"Open Folder\" and run the server manually.<br/><br/>If unsure how to do so, please contact the packs support pages for more further help."
msgstr "我们无法为你启动此服务器。请使用“打开文件夹”并手动运行服务器。<br/><br/>如果不确定如何操作，请联系整合包的支持页面获取更多帮助。"

msgid "We have detected that ATLauncher cannot write files in it's current location.<br/><br/>We cannot continue to run, you must move this folder somewhere else with write access.<br/><br/>Try moving to a folder in your Desktop or another drive.<br/><br/>You can also try running ATLauncher as administrator, but this is not recommended."
msgstr "我们检测到 ATLauncher 无法在当前位置写入文件。<br/><br/>无法继续运行，你必须将此文件夹移动到其他有写入权限的位置。<br/><br/>可以尝试移动到桌面上的文件夹或其他盘符。<br/><br/>你也可以尝试以管理员身份运行 ATLauncher，但不建议这样做。"

msgid "We have detected that you're running 64 bit Windows but not 64 bit Java.<br/><br/>This will cause severe issues playing all packs if not fixed.<br/><br/>Do you want to close the launcher and learn how to fix this issue now?"
msgstr "我们检测到你在 64 位 Windows 上运行的不是 64 位 Java。<br/><br/>如不修复，游玩所有整合包都会出现严重问题。<br/><br/>现在要关闭启动器并了解如何修复此问题吗？"

msgid "We have detected that you're running ATLauncher from within OneDrive.<br/><br/>This can cause serious issues and you should move the folder outside of OneDrive.<br/><br/>Do you want to close the launcher and do this now?"
msgstr "我们检测到你在 OneDrive 中运行 ATLauncher。<br/><br/>这可能导致严重问题，你应该将此文件夹移出 OneDrive。<br/><br/>现在要关闭启动器并执行此操作吗？"

msgid "We have detected that you're running ATLauncher from within Program Files.<br/><br/>This can cause serious issues and you should move the folder outside of Program Files.<br/><br/>Do you want to close the launcher and do this now?"
msgstr "我们检测到你在 Program Files 中运行 ATLauncher。<br/><br/>这可能导致严重问题，你应该将此文件夹移出 Program Files。<br/><br/>现在要关闭启动器并执行此操作吗？"

msgid "We were unable to download some of the mods from this pack.<br/>This is likely due to the author of that mod disabling third party clients from downloading it.<br/><br/>You'll be prompted shortly to start downloading these mods manually through your browser to your downloads folder.<br/>Once you've downloaded the file that was opened in your browser to your downloads folder, you can continue through all the mods that have disabled this toggle.<br/><br/>This process is unfortunate, but we don't have any choice in this matter and has to be done this way."
msgstr "我们无法下载此整合包中的部分模组。<br/>这很可能是因为该模组的作者禁用了第三方客户端下载。<br/><br/>稍后会提示你通过浏览器手动下载这些模组到你的下载文件夹。<br/>当你把浏览器中打开的文件下载到下载文件夹后，就可以继续处理所有禁用了此开关的模组。<br/><br/>这个过程实属无奈，但我们对此别无选择，只能这样做。"

msgid "We were unable to download this mod.<br/>This is likely due to the author of the mod disabling third party clients from downloading it.<br/><br/>You'll be prompted shortly to download the mod manually through your browser to your downloads folder.<br/>Once you've downloaded the file that was opened in your browser to your downloads folder, we can continue with installing the mod.<br/><br/>This process is unfortunate, but we don't have any choice in this matter and has to be done this way."
msgstr "我们无法下载此模组。<br/>这很可能是因为该模组的作者禁用了第三方客户端下载。<br/><br/>稍后会提示你通过浏览器手动下载该模组到你的下载文件夹。<br/>当你把浏览器中打开的文件下载到下载文件夹后，我们就可以继续安装该模组。<br/><br/>这个过程实属无奈，但我们对此别无选择，只能这样做。"

msgid "We were unable to download this modpack.<br/>This is likely due to the author of the modpack disabling third party clients from downloading it.<br/><br/>You'll be prompted shortly to download the modpack manually through your browser to your downloads folder.<br/>Once you've downloaded the file that was opened in your browser to your downloads folder, we can continue with installing the modpack.<br/><br/>This process is unfortunate, but we don't have any choice in this matter and has to be done this way."
msgstr "我们无法下载此整合包。<br/>这很可能是因为该整合包的作者禁用了第三方客户端下载。<br/><br/>稍后会提示你通过浏览器手动下载该整合包到你的下载文件夹。<br/>当你把浏览器中打开的文件下载到下载文件夹后，我们就可以继续安装该整合包。<br/><br/>这个过程实属无奈，但我们对此别无选择，只能这样做。"

msgid "Which account to use when launching this instance. Use Launcher Default will use whichever account is selected in the launcher."
msgstr "启动该实例时使用的账户。“使用启动器默认”将使用启动器中当前选中的账户。"

