msgid "You're currently using a version of Java not managed by the launcher.<br/><br/>Letting the launcher manage it's own version of Java is better for support and ease of use.<br/><br/>This process is automatic and doesn't affect any Java installs outside of the launcher.<br/><br/>Do you want to let the launcher manage it's own version of Java?"
msgstr "你当前使用的 Java 版本不是由启动器管理的。<br/><br/>让启动器管理自己的 Java 版本更便于获得支持和使用。<br/><br/>此过程是自动的，不会影响启动器之外的任何 Java 安装。<br/><br/>要让启动器管理自己的 Java 版本吗？"

#. {0} is the minimum Java version required
msgid "You're running an out of date version of Java and the launcher will no longer open.<br/><br/>If you see this message after updating Java, please make sure you updated to<br/>at least Java {0} and uninstalled any older versions of Java from your system.<br/><br/>The launcher will now exit."
msgstr "你运行的 Java 版本已过时，启动器将无法再打开。<br/><br/>如果你在更新 Java 后看到此消息，请确保你至少更新到了<br/>Java {0}，并从系统中卸载了所有旧版本的 Java。<br/><br/>启动器现在将退出。"

#. {0} is the minimum Java version required
msgid "You're running an out of date version of Java.<br/><br/><font color=\"red\"><b>Soon the launcher will no longer open without updating Java.</b></font><br/><br/>If you see this message after updating Java, please make sure you updated to<br/>at least Java {0} and uninstalled any older versions of Java from your system.<br/><br/>Do you want to update Java now?"
msgstr "你运行的 Java 版本已过时。<br/><br/><font color=\"red\"><b>很快，不更新 Java 启动器将无法再打开。</b></font><br/><br/>如果你在更新 Java 后看到此消息，请确保你至少更新到了<br/>Java {0}，并从系统中卸载了所有旧版本的 Java。<br/><br/>现在要更新 Java 吗？"

msgid "You're running an out of date version of Java.<br/><br/>In the future the launcher will no longer work without updating this.<br/><br/>This process is automatic and doesn't affect any Java installs outside of the launcher.<br/><br/>Do you want to do it now?"
msgstr "你运行的 Java 版本已过时。<br/><br/>今后不更新 Java 启动器将无法工作。<br/><br/>此过程是自动的，不会影响启动器之外的任何 Java 安装。<br/><br/>现在要更新吗？"

#. {0} is the minimum Java version required
msgid "You're running an out of date version of Java.<br/><br/>The launcher requires at least Java {0} to run.<br/><br/>The launcher can install this automatically for you, otherwise the launcher will exit.<br/><br/>Do you want to install it now?"
msgstr "你运行的 Java 版本已过时。<br/><br/>启动器至少需要 Java {0} 才能运行。<br/><br/>启动器可以为你自动安装，否则启动器将退出。<br/><br/>现在要安装吗？"

msgid "Your exported instance contains mods not on Modrinth and were included in the overrides folder. If you're uploading this to Modrinth, you will need to make sure you have permissions to distribute the below mods, else your modpack will get denied on Modrinth."
msgstr "你导出的实例包含不在 Modrinth 上的模组，它们已包含在 overrides 文件夹中。如果你要上传到 Modrinth，需要确保你拥有分发下列模组的权限，否则你的整合包将被 Modrinth 拒绝。"

